      "message": "Maybe it is better to still keep the host KVM setting up the user return msrs for the host KVM to have a sense about this, in case some code still refers that, like the `arch/x86/kvm/cpuid.c:1324 kvm_set_cpu_caps+0x1019/0x10a0`",
