      "message": "Do we need to add MSR_EFER here? Based on my limited understanding we enable `VM_ENTRY_LOAD_IA32_EFER`, `VM_EXIT_SAVE_IA32_EFER` and `VM_EXIT_LOAD_IA32_EFER` so pkvm saves host EFER  and loads hyp EFER on VEMXIT and loads the saved host EFER back on VMENTRY. So host cannot change the EFER as an attack surace?\n\nAlso intercepting this would mean that host doesn\u0027t see the write as VMENTRY reverts back to `GUEST_IA32_EFER` for host?",
